{"Date": "10/23/2017", "Record Number": "ZCBL2017-0384", "Record Type": "Zoning Certificate Business License", "Description": "Eve Arbel, MA Somatic Counseling Psychology, provides counseling sessions for mental health and wellness. Eve works with individuals, couples, and groups, and treats issues including depression, anxiety, trauma, grief and loss, life transitions, personal growth, relationships and communication, physical pain, and life purpose. Eve draws upon a variety of modalities from the fields of body psychotherapy, ecotherapy, and energy healing. Eve uses a holistic approach, incorporating mind, body, and soul, is non pathologizing, and aims to help individuals, families, communities, and the collective on our path of healing and evolution.", "Project Name": "Eve Arbel Holistic Counseling", "Status": "Withdrawn", "Action": "", "Expiration Date": "", "Short Notes": "", "_cells": ["", "10/23/2017", "ZCBL2017-0384", "Zoning Certificate Business License", "Eve Arbel, MA Somatic Counseling Psychology, provides counseling sessions for mental health and wellness. Eve works with individuals, couples, and groups, and treats issues including depression, anxiety, trauma, grief and loss, life transitions, personal growth, relationships and communication, physical pain, and life purpose. Eve draws upon a variety of modalities from the fields of body psychotherapy, ecotherapy, and energy healing. Eve uses a holistic approach, incorporating mind, body, and soul, is non pathologizing, and aims to help individuals, families, communities, and the collective on our path of healing and evolution.", "Eve Arbel Holistic Counseling", "Withdrawn", "", "", "", "2800 ADELINE St, BERKELEY CA 94703"], "capdetail_href": "/BERKELEY/Cap/CapDetail.aspx?Module=Planning&TabName=Planning&capID1=17PLN&capID2=00000&capID3=00894&agencyCode=BERKELEY&IsToShowInspection="}
